{"_id":"e65f75e4d1d930b2","name":"A Blade or Two","type":"item","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"Perhaps you carry a butterfly knife. Or a big military-issue combat knife. Or a heavy butcher’s cleaver. Or a machete.","class":"","load":"1"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"ce86608fb115059a","name":"Electro-Blade","type":"item","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"A broad, heavy blade with a plasmoleum-powered device built into the hilt. If the sharpened edge doesn’t finish them, the explosive release of electricity will. ","class":"","load":"1"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"d566f6a37b3fe8ea","name":"Advanced Visual Sensors","type":"item","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"Your eyes can switch to various visual modes, including night vision, heat vision, and ultra-zoom.","class":"","load":"1"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"d3fdf6ddbed40fab","name":"Arclighter","type":"item","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"A handheld tool that carries a small reserve of plasmoleum. A flick of the thumb produces a small arc of crackling energy, and with a twist of the dial it turns into a steady beam of light. Used as a flashlight, cigarette lighter, welding torch, or for anything from supercharging firearm rounds, overloading electronic systems, or even jamming into a knife’s hilt to jury-rig a quick electro-blade.","class":"","load":"1"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"aab565d3522c2bd4","name":"Armor","type":"item","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"Layers of impact-resistant fabric combined with areas of rigid plate. Bulky and uncomfortable, but offers unparalleled protection.","class":"","load":"1"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"2d06921261838112","name":"Burglary Gear","type":"item","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"A set of lockpicks. A small pry-bar. Cannister of lubricant to silence squeaky hinges. A spool of high-tensile wire and a set of powerful magnets. A small pouch of fine sand. A glasscutter.","class":"","load":"1"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"e9b44803e84c9c4a","name":"Climbing Gear","type":"item","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"A large coil of nylon rope. Grappling hooks. A small pouch of chalk dust. A climbing harness with loops and carabiners. A set of steel pitons and a small mallet. Suction cups.","class":"","load":"1"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"da135801844b5cf9","name":"Demolition Tools","type":"item","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"A heavy drill. Crowbar. Explosive putty and blasting caps. Thermite charges. Vials of acid. A sledgehammer. A blowtorch.","class":"","load":"1"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"4b267b669530f139","name":"Documents","type":"item","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"A folder of paperwork on a variety of topics, including a registry of the nobility, bluecoat commanders, and other notable citizens. Blank pages, a pen. A number of interesting maps. Some relevant print-outs of archival information, prepared before the score.","class":"","load":"1"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"67aecf6e05fca1ee","name":"Tinkering Tools","type":"item","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"Tools and spare parts for messing with electronics and mechanisms. A wrench, drill, and spanner. Tweezers, pliers, precision screwdrivers. A soldering iron. A second wrench. Oscilloscope, circuit tester, and heat sink. Jumper wires. Magnifying loupe. ","class":"","load":"1"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"e8354b5531522341","name":"Handcannon","type":"item","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"A heavy, large-bore handgun that hits like a sledgehammer. Loud. Slow to reload.","class":"","load":"1"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"36c35dbdc6c041d7","name":"Hidden Compartment","type":"item","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"Your frame has a secret compartment that escapes even the most thorough search. Lead-lined to prevent x-ray scanning.","class":"","load":"1"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"c6f24068bd2e2842","name":"Jet Propulsion","type":"item","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"Your frame includes jet boosters that provide a limited form of flight (either slow or temporary).","class":"","load":"1"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"fbc85117c299af79","name":"Lifelike Appearance","type":"item","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"Utilizing the latest super-realistic latex, you are masterfully crafted to pass for a living being (unless closely scrutinized).","class":"","load":"1"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"e49f5deb0966aefc","name":"Paranormal Implements","type":"item","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"A resonance gauge for monitoring resonance field activity. Infrared thermometer. Echo frequency scanner. A small mirror. A vial of ultraplasm. A portable echo containment unit. A resonance disruptor. Safety goggles and gloves. ","class":"","load":"1"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"1b4e823f2841bd22","name":"Pump-Action Scattergun","type":"item","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"A simple but very effective firearm that delivers blasts of shot over short distances. Developed for use in the narrow streets and cramped alleyways of modern cities. ","class":"","load":"1"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"18aeda91c579ba4b","name":"Silenced Shooter","type":"item","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"A semi-automatic handgun with a modest calibre. Quiet as a whisper.","class":"","load":"1"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"a5ad13fb1af72a76","name":"Smokescreen Emitter","type":"item","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"An emergency system that can exude a dark, acrid cloud of smoke — enough to fill a large room.","class":"","load":"1"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"8374b9e53bf7a1e1","name":"Subterfuge Supplies","type":"item","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"A disguise kit. A selection of blank documents, ready for the forger's hand. Invisible ink. A forged ID card. Microfilm camera.","class":"","load":"1"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"96bb7729a5ad2998","name":"Surveillance Hardware","type":"item","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"The latest espionage equipment, including an ultra-sensitive microphone that can hear at long range or through walls, and tape-feed to record this audio.","class":"","load":"1"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"b6feab5bf4e41c53","name":"Fine snub-nosed handcannon","type":"item","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"Maybe you're no great shot, but this thing packs a hell of a punch and can be concealed in a pocket.","class":"Hound","load":"0"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"5245c2efe16495d4","name":"A loyal, clever pet","type":"item","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"Companion might be a better word - a hunter. They never let you down (except when they do). Did you choose them, or did they choose you?","class":"Hound","load":"0"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"7d41ee54da7cc873","name":"Binoculars","type":"item","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"See distant objects with greater clarity and detail. Amazing.","class":"Hound","load":"0"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"98d35451f4fbfb34","name":"Hipflask of the good stuff","type":"item","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"Numb pain, clean wounds, or bond with new friends. What's engraved on the outside?","class":"Hound","load":"0"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"c74f1b4efee919e1","name":"Pocketful of focus pills","type":"item","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"For when you need steady hands, an alert mind, and laser-like concentration. Highly addictive; tick a 4-segment addiction clock when used (this can be resisted). If the clock fills, you no longer get any benefit from the pills but have to take them every score anyway or suffer the moderate harm 'withdrawal symptoms'. Once this harm is taken, reset the addiction clock.","class":"Hound","load":"0"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"4ed958c40e177788","name":"RF radio handset","type":"item","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"A resonance field radio. A small handheld unit tuned to a secure frequency.","class":"Hound","load":"0"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"f535f95896d1eb01","name":"Fine tinkering tools","type":"item","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"Tools and spare parts for messing with electronics and mechanisms. A wrench, drill, and spanner. Tweezers, pliers, precision screwdrivers. A soldering iron. A second wrench. Oscilloscope, circuit tester, and heat sink. Jumper wires. Magnifying loupe. ","class":"Intellectual","load":"0"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"028303727bfbbc64","name":"Experimental laser cannon","type":"item","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"A plasmoleum-fueled device that generates a continuous beam of electroplasmic radiation. A dangerous and potentially unstable weapon that will incinerate pretty much anything it's pointed at.","class":"Intellectual","load":"0"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"decc5ac279a0a9b7","name":"Sparkmind assistant","type":"item","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"Sparkminds are a form of artificial intelligence, utilizing a matrix of circuits and chips to harness the raw intellect of a resonance entity. Where did you get yours? Did you invent it, steal it, or something else? ","class":"Intellectual","load":"0"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"e50e4c227b030e67","name":"Gadgets","type":"item","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":" You can create gadgets in a flashback and track their load here. If they're simple, just the flashback may be enough. More ambitious gadgets might require you spend a downtime action crafting them (additional downtime actions cost 1 stack).","class":"Intellectual","load":"0"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"c74f1b4efee919e1","name":"Pocketful of focus pills","type":"item","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"For when you need steady hands, an alert mind, and laser-like concentration. Highly addictive; tick a 4-segment addiction clock when used (this can be resisted). If the clock fills, you no longer get any benefit from the pills but have to take them every score anyway or suffer the moderate harm 'withdrawal symptoms'. Once this harm is taken, reset the addiction clock.","class":"Intellectual","load":"0"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"4ed958c40e177788","name":"RF radio handset","type":"item","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"A resonance field radio. A small handheld unit tuned to a secure frequency.","class":"Intellectual","load":"0"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"f9a034f22dae4155","name":"Truth serum syringe","type":"item","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"Delivers one dose of a truth serum. The victim becomes delirious and suggestible for up to an hour, open to answering all sorts of questions.","class":"Operative","load":"0"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"2f3e944eeae0d200","name":"Fine sniper rifle","type":"item","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"A high-powered sniper rifle complete with silencer. Deadly at long range, unwieldy in close quarters","class":"Operative","load":"0"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"dc4916bea924a0eb","name":"Tiny tracking device","type":"item","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"A small tracking device (adhesive and/or magnetic) and a handheld gadget that show the device's current location. Works reliably up to a distance of two city districts away.","class":"Operative","load":"0"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"97dd53468551bc96","name":"Fine silenced shooter","type":"item","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"A finely-made semi-automatic handgun with a modest calibre. Quiet as a whisper.","class":"Operative","load":"0"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"4e06f7905b2b0bd9","name":"Fine disguise","type":"item","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"A state-of-the-art disguise of one specific person. Includes clothing as well as a super-realistic latex mask and wig. Could fool their own family, assuming you're roughly the same height and build. If you’re carrying this item as a second outfit to change into, it counts as 2 load.","class":"Operative","load":"0"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"4ed958c40e177788","name":"RF radio handset","type":"item","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"A resonance field radio. A small handheld unit tuned to a secure frequency.","class":"Operative","load":"0"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"d7d8951249e513c9","name":"Fine resonance gauge","type":"item","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"A handheld device that measures resonance in its vicinity. Can be used to detect paranormal activity and locate resonance entities.","class":"Paranormalist","load":"0"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"c2e7c0ba493154b6","name":"Resonance accelerator pack","type":"item","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"A handheld particle-thrower connected to a backpack-sized resonance accelerator. Blasts a stream of highly focused, polarized electroplasmic energy. Suitable for grappling with a resonance entity and dragging it into a containment unit.","class":"Paranormalist","load":"0"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"7ad59a8e8d1604be","name":"Fine echo containment unit","type":"item","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"A device used to hold a single resonance entity for containment and safe transport. Designed for Class I - IV resonance entities. Not advised for Class V or above.","class":"Paranormalist","load":"0"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"5ddad6e8884c5487","name":"Psychic amplification device","type":"item","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"An experimental piece of equipment that focuses the wearer's paranormal abilities. Also affords some measure of protection against paranormal assault. What does yours look like; is it a helmet, a circlet, a glove or gauntlet, or something else? Did you invent it yourself, or acquire it some other way?","class":"Paranormalist","load":"0"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"1583182b3eb53a48","name":"Loyal resonance entity","type":"item","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"How did you come by this entity, and why do they help you? Are they the echo of a human or... something else? Cohort (Expert: Paranormal Assistant).","class":"Paranormalist","load":"0"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"4ed958c40e177788","name":"RF radio handset","type":"item","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"A resonance field radio. A small handheld unit tuned to a secure frequency.","class":"Paranormalist","load":"0"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"d5d43be9b7c2ad57","name":"Provocative manifesto","type":"item","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"A short punchy document declaring the views, motives, and intentions of a political movement. Has the potential to incite a crowd, or to enrage the authorities.","class":"Radical","load":"0"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"6a2c9401cd6fbed1","name":"Nondescript change of clothes","type":"item","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"An outfit of perfectly ordinary cut, for blending in with the crowd of whatever district you're in.","class":"Radical","load":"0"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"aa234a7fa08b02e3","name":"Bandolier","type":"item","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"A strap worn across the body, fitted with specially-padded pouches to hold three explosives or bombs. When you employ an item from the bandolier, choose one from the list (or one of your own custom-made explosives). During downtime, you automatically refill your bandoliers, so long as you have reasonable access to a supplier or workshop.","class":"Radical","load":"0"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"aa234a7fa08b02e3","name":"Bandolier","type":"item","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"A strap worn across the body, fitted with specially-padded pouches to hold three explosives or bombs. When you employ an item from the bandolier, choose one from the list (or one of your own custom-made explosives). During downtime, you automatically refill your bandoliers, so long as you have reasonable access to a supplier or workshop.","class":"Radical","load":"0"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"2b262853b978588b","name":"Pocketful of go-go pills","type":"item","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"Xantara Pharm's finest uppers, for when you need pure, explosive energy. You'll run your mouth (what do you say that you didn't mean to?), and take the passing harm 'jittery' when they wear off (these consequences can be resisted).","class":"Radical","load":"0"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"4ed958c40e177788","name":"RF radio handset","type":"item","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"A resonance field radio. A small handheld unit tuned to a secure frequency.","class":"Radical","load":"0"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"568cd219bb361945","name":"Fine clothes & jewelry","type":"item","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"A fabulous outfit with a flattering cut, in the latest style. Sure to impress. If you’re carrying this item as a second outfit to change into, it counts as 2 load.","class":"Swinger","load":"0"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"8163cdb95d86083c","name":"Fine two-seat autopod","type":"item","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"The latest model. Is it built for racing, impressing, or surprising your enemies?","class":"Swinger","load":"0"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"02c747a14208163f","name":"An invitation to the party","type":"item","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"Everybody knows it's not a party if you're not invited.","class":"Swinger","load":"0"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"9da221cb6b55ef76","name":"Fine concealed shooter","type":"item","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"A semi-automatic handgun with a modest calibre. It’s very difficult to detect on your person, even if you’re searched.","class":"Swinger","load":"0"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"3e6edf3fa33067e7","name":"Pocketful of sleeping pills","type":"item","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"If someone takes a few of these pills they'll quickly fall unconscious for at least an hour. The victim’s sleep isn’t paranormal, but it is deep — they can only be roused with some effort.","class":"Swinger","load":"0"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
